/ What the page says when there is nothing to show. Always there, hidden while there are files, so a refresh can bring it back.
#changes_empty class="p-12 text-center text-fg-muted #{ "hidden" if @files.any? }"
  | Nothing has changed: #{ @diff.working_tree? ? "the working tree" : @diff.head } matches #{ @diff.base }.
